08013B98 scaled-shadow-graphic-return

Sprite_ApplyAnimation pops its Thumb return address into r0 and the frame write uses r6.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/scaled_shadow.c
+++ b/src/scaled_shadow.c
@@ -242,4 +242,7 @@
     Sprite_ApplyAnimation(sprite, resource);
     sprite->frame = frame;
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return 0x08013BB3; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
 
